            #ARM1733mN9oP1qR3sT5uV7wX: ^"Power" TEXT "Chastise the Disobedient, 0 points, Init +3, Corpus: Every strike of Bordelon's switch inflicts double wound penalties, though extra penalties vanish after an hour."
