            #ARM1773sT4uV6wX8yZ0aB2cD: ^"Power" TEXT "Dominate Wolves, 0 points, Init +18, Animal: Establishes absolute control over any wolf. Applies to mundane wolves, wolves with Might, and characters who naturally take wolf form (shapechangers, lycanthropes, skinchangers, Bjornaer with wolf heartbeasts), but not magi using spells. Lasts until Polandrus drops it, wolf enters Dominion aura 3+, or power is dispelled."
            #ARM1773eF5gH7iJ9kL1mN3oP: ^"Power" TEXT "Coagulation, 3 points, Init -1, Animal"
